  "content": "<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/T8Fpxcl7/images/b082e8bc447ae9e446948c356bbdedd7a2bea422.png\" alt=\"更多畫作！\"></p><p><strong>立即在您的 Minecraft 世界中獲得超過 50 幅全新畫作</strong>！厭倦了有限的繪畫選項嗎？這個模組為您開啟藝術創作的無限寶庫。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/too-many-paintings-forge-fabric/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=26.1&amp;showAlphaFiles=hide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ZmYDVgW.png\" alt=\"下載 26.1 更新\" width=\"217\" height=\"36\"></a></p><h2>🖼️ 更多畫作</h2><ul>\n<li>知名畫作：用梵谷、達文西等傳奇藝術家的經典作品點綴您的 Minecraft 大廳！</li>\n<li>相容於現有世界：此模組可無縫整合至您現有的世界，讓您隨處立即放置新畫作。</li>\n</ul><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/9rlXSyLg/images/491c87c96cd602ec45774ce0b0cb9fe4d25ba074.png\" alt=\"為筆記型電腦存錢中！\" width=\"1150\" height=\"227\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Axperty\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/patreon-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"支持我按鈕\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fpaypal.me%252fkevgelhorn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/intergrav/devins-badges/refs/heads/v3/assets/cozy/donate/paypal-singular_64h.png\" alt=\"捐款按鈕\"></a></p>",
